================= FINAL REPORT =================
FINAL CONFIG LEFT RUNNING: 3/1 (5090 max_workers=3 via Scheduled Task PatoLex_OCR_5090, supervisor 75s stagger; 5080 = 1 worker 5080-1 via PatoLex_OCR_5080). BOTH VERIFIED PRODUCING OCR (pages advancing on both at 19:06).

